#, no-c-format
msgid "Open folders in separate windows"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, a new &konqueror; window will be created when you "
"open a folder, rather than simply showing that folder's contents in the "
"current "
"window."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show 'Delete' menu entries which bypass the trashcan"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this if you want <quote>Delete</quote> menu commands to be displayed on "
"the desktop and in the file manager's context menus. You can always delete "
"files by holding the &Shift; key while calling <guimenuitem>"
"Move to Trash</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:56
